<div class="sec sand" id="faq"><h2 style="text-align:center">Preorder questions</h2>
<div class="faq">
<details><summary>When will my order ship?<span>+</span></summary><div>Your order ships about 2 weeks after the preorder closes. We'll email you tracking as soon as it's on its way.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can I buy pieces on their own?<span>+</span></summary><div>Yes. Every piece is sold separately. Buy a matching set to save on the pair.</div></details>
<details><summary>How does sizing fit?<span>+</span></summary><div>Each piece is cut to its own fit. <b>Oversized Tee:</b> boxy and relaxed, so take your usual size for the intended loose look or size down for a closer fit. <b>Baby Tee, Cropped Zip Hoodie and Long Sleeve Crop:</b> fitted and cropped, so take your usual size, or size up if you're between sizes or want more room. <b>Zip Hoodie:</b> relaxed fit. <b>Wide-Leg Pants and Shorts:</b> drawstring waist, so they adjust to you; shorts come in knee or short length. Not sure? Email us at litymiclothing@gmail.com and we'll help you pick.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can I return or exchange a preorder?<span>+</span></summary><div>You can cancel a preorder for a full refund any time before it goes into production. Unworn items with tags attached can be returned or exchanged within 14 days of delivery. If something arrives faulty or isn't what you ordered, email us within 30 days and we'll replace or refund it. Email litymiclothing@gmail.com with your order number to start a return or exchange.</div></details>
<details><summary>Where do you ship?<span>+</span></summary><div>We currently ship within Australia only. Shipping is tracked and the cost is shown at checkout. Orders ship about 2 weeks after the preorder closes.</div></details>
<details><summary>How do I contact you?<span>+</span></summary><div>Email <a href="mailto:litymiclothing@gmail.com" style="color:#7A5F3F;text-decoration:underline">litymiclothing@gmail.com</a>. We reply as soon as we can.</div></details></div></div>

